        <mxCell id="legend" value="Chen notation: rectangle = entity; ellipse = attribute; underlined attribute = identifier; diamond = relationship.&#10;(min,max) beside an entity gives its participation in the relationship; N = many.&#10;A User can act as both guest and host. Each Review belongs to a completed Booking; its author is that booking’s guest.&#10;Academic model inspired by Airbnb; not the platform’s internal schema." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
